      "id": "umvnc9cel",
      "title": "繁星《岁月和鸣》音乐会 | Harmony Through the Years – Starry Choir Concert 2026, Winnipeg",
      "category": "News",
      "date": "2026-10-25",
      "body": "Harmony Through the Years\n\nStarry Choir Concert 2026\n\nSaturday, December 12, 2026 · 2:15 PM · Winnipeg\n\n👉 Buy Tickets\n\nAbout the Concert\n\nAs the long winter settles in, the Starry Choir proudly presents its annual concert, Harmony Through the Years.\n\nWhen voices rise in song, cultures draw closer together. This concert brings together several of Winnipeg's Chinese choirs, joined by a special guest Filipino choir, for an afternoon of music that crosses languages and art forms. The program features:\n\n\t•\tPowerful multi-part choral performances\n\t•\tA soaring tenor solo\n\t•\tA pure and heartwarming children's choir\n\t•\tTraditional guzheng (Chinese zither) music\n\t•\tGraceful Chinese classical dance\n\nJoin us on a warm winter afternoon as we celebrate the years we share and the harmony that connects us all.\n\nEvent Details\n\n\t•\tDate: Saturday, December 12, 2026\n\t•\tTime: Doors open at 2:00 PM; concert begins at 2:15 PM\n\t•\tVenue: St. Andrew's River Heights United Church\n255 Oak Street, Winnipeg, MB (View map)\n\t•\tTickets: $25 (limited seating — get yours early!)\n\nHow to Get Tickets\n\nScan the QR code on the poster to buy tickets online\n\nAfter purchase, your e-ticket will be sent to your email. Please show it at the door.\n\nYou can also contact us for tickets:\n\n\t•\tEmail: starrychoir@hotmail.com\n\t•\tWeChat: StarryChoir",
